ent","C":"last year's budget","D":"audit paras"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Budget estimates are required to be","options":{"A":"always high","B":"inflated","C":"as accurate and realistic as possible","D":"always low"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"Expenditure on a new service requires","options":{"A":"suspense","B":"deposit","C":"re-appropriation","D":"token provision with Parliament approval"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"The object of budgetary control is","options":{"A":"keeping expenditure within sanctioned grants","B":"avoiding audit","C":"raising fares","D":"increasing expenditure"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Expenditure against budget is reviewed","options":{"A":"yearly","B":"monthly","C":"weekly","D":"once in five years"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Anticipated savings in grants should be","options":{"A":"kept secret","B":"spent hastily","C":"surrendered as soon as foreseen","D":"carried forward"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"Rush of expenditure in March is","options":{"A":"ignored","B":"rewarded","C":"encouraged","D":"prohibited"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Re-appropriation means","options":{"A":"transfer of savings between heads within a grant","B":"external loan","C":"audit objection","D":"new taxation"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Re-appropriation cannot be used for","options":{"A":"creating new services","B":"increasing the total of the grant","C":"meeting excess under a head","D":"using savings"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Unspent budget grants at year-end","options":{"A":"transferred to next year","B":"carried forward","C":"lapse on 31st March","D":"kept in deposit"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"Allotment of budget means","options":{"A":"tax collection","B":"tendering","C":"audit","D":"distribution of grants to disbursing officers"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Expenditure against budget allotment","options":{"A":"must not exceed without authority","B":"can exceed in March","C":"needs no check","D":"may exceed freely"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Railway budget procedure is laid down in","options":{"A":"Indian Penal Code","B":"Finance Code Volume I","C":"Stores Code","D":"Establishment Code"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"The Pink Book contains","options":{"A":"fare tables","B":"staff list","C":"works programme with financial outlays","D":"train timings"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"Railway budget estimates originate","options":{"A":"by CAG","B":"by Parliament","C":"at Board level only","D":"department-wise from units upward"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Ways and means estimates relate to","options":{"A":"cash flow requirements","B":"track length","C":"train punctuality","D":"staff strength"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Railway Budget speech presents","options":{"A":"audit findings","B":"policy and financial proposals","C":"staff grievances","D":"tender results"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Outcome budget emphasises","options":{"A":"staff numbers","B":"only money figures","C":"expenditure linked to physical outcomes","D":"audit paras"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"Which is NOT a standard Railway budget document?","options":{"A":"Explanatory Memorandum","B":"Pink Book","C":"Demands for Grants","D":"Gender Budget statement"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Notes explaining budget provisions appear in","options":{"A":"Explanatory Memorandum","B":"Time Table","C":"Whistle manual","D":"Pink Book"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The budget serves as","options":{"A":"only a legal formality","B":"a financial plan and control tool","C":"an audit report","D":"a loan document"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Ultimate control over railway finance rests with","options":{"A":"Zonal offices","B":"Railway Board","C":"Parliament","D":"CAG"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"Appropriation Accounts are examined by","options":{"A":"Staff Council","B":"Tender Committee","C":"Estimates Committee","D":"Public Accounts Committee"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"The Estimates Committee deals with","options":{"A":"suggesting economies","B":"fixing fares","C":"recruiting staff","D":"sanctioning works"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The budget should be passed","options":{"A":"after the year ends","B":"before the financial year begins","C":"mid-year","D":"any time"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"Budget estimates of Zonal Railways are scrutinised at","options":{"A":"Parliament","B":"Divisional office","C":"Railway Board","D":"CAG"},"answer":"C"}]